sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Analyst UI
    participant API as FastAPI Service
    participant BG as Background Wrapper
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway
    participant FS as File and Analysis Storage
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>API: POST cases with client_name and type and PDFs
    API->>FS: Save KYC PDFs under case_id folder
    API-->>U: status queued with case_id no DB write
    API->>BG: Schedule run_pdf or run_subject job
    Note over BG: Index pages with global numbers
    BG->>LLM: Extract structure parties edges roles
    BG->>LLM: Extract source of wealth per party
    BG->>LLM: Extract identity checks per party
    BG->>LLM: Detect case metadata and applicant
    Note over BG: Collect 8-angle OSINT evidence if name_search
    BG->>LLM: Synthesize Profile360 JSON if name_search
    Note over BG: Bridge profile to parties and web hits
    Note over BG: Resolve UBOs with threshold 25 pct
    Note over BG: Screen PEP sanctions adverse geography
    Note over BG: Score 11 factors and apply hard stops
    BG->>LLM: Write EDD rationale from compact JSON
    BG->>FS: Write versioned analysis folder
    BG->>DB: Commit cases plus ubos hits measures review
    U->>API: GET status with progress guess until row exists
    API-->>U: Current phase and progress
    U->>API: GET result plus clients plus history
    API-->>U: Risk band decision UBOs and measures
